==English==

===Etymology===
Chosen for the rhyme. Cliche made popularized by the song "Check Yo Self" (1993) by hip hop artist {{w|Ice Cube}}. Older sources include Dion's Song "Two Ton Feather" (1966) with  the lyric "Check yourself, don't wreck yourself."

===Phrase===
{{en-head|phr}}

# {{lb|en|colloquial}} Consider the consequences of your actions before you end up in trouble.

